  <static seed="427" source="csafranski/5.5aHW_prob4.pg">
    <statement><p>What is the correct form of the partial fraction decomposition for the following integral? <me>\int \frac{12 (x^{8} + 3)}{(x - 4)(x^2 - 1)^2 (x^2 + 4)^2} \, dx</me></p>
<p><ol form="buttons" marker="A" name="AnSwEr0001">
<li>
<p>There is no partial fraction decomposition yet because there is cancellation.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\displaystyle \int \left( \frac{A}{x - 4} + \frac{B}{(x^2-1)^2} + \frac{C}{(x^2 + 4)^2} \right)\, dx </m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\displaystyle \int \left( \frac{A}{x - 4} + \frac{Bx+C}{x^2-1} + \frac{Dx+E}{(x^2-1)^2} + \frac{Fx+G}{x^2 + 4} + \frac{Hx+J}{(x^2 + 4)^2} \right)\, dx </m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\displaystyle \int \left( \frac{A}{x - 4} + \frac{B}{x+1} + \frac{C}{(x+1)^2} + \frac{D}{x-1} + \frac{E}{(x-1)^2} + \frac{Fx+G}{x^2 + 4} + \frac{Hx+J}{(x^2 + 4)^2} \right)\, dx </m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p>There is no partial fraction decomposition because the denominator does not factor.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>There is no partial fraction decomposition yet because long division must be done first.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\displaystyle \int \left( \frac{A}{x - 4} + \frac{Bx+C}{(x^2-1)^2} + \frac{Dx+E}{(x^2 + 4)^2} \right)\, dx </m></p>
</li>
</ol></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\text{D}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
